        <p>We started JP Roll-Off Service in 2000 with one truck and a simple promise: answer the phone, show up on time, charge what we quoted. Over two decades later, that's still the whole pitch. We're a family-owned, Minority- and Small-Business-certified hauler, and we help project managers earn LEED points through proper disposal.</p>
